{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-04","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區巷道匯入，右轉與停讓如何辨識？","intro":"主要道路約 20 m、次要道路約 4 m，兩側無人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-04-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-04-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-04-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"warning","title":"幹道缺少來車警示","text":"主要道路未清楚提醒駕駛留意次要道路來車。"},{"id":"turn","title":"右轉跨越機慢車道","text":"主要道路右轉進入巷道時，須跨越機慢車道，容易產生交織。"},{"id":"direction","title":"巷道出口方向提示不足","text":"次要道路僅能右轉，但出口缺少清楚的行向提示。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[47,48],"strategy":{"title":"提高鄉區匯入口辨識度","intro":"以槽化、導引線與讓路管制，整理主要道路和巷道的銜接。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-04-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"guidance","title":"標出匯入口與行車路徑","text":"在主要道路劃設路口行車導引線，讓進出巷道的路徑更清楚。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"space","title":"區分路肩與車行空間","text":"以槽化線整理寬路肩，避免路口可行駛範圍過於模糊。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"yield","title":"說清次要道路讓路規則","text":"配置分向線、讓路標誌與讓路線，提醒巷道車輛先確認主要道路來車。","moduleId":"M2-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-04-unsignalized-rural-merge-t.typ","sha256":"93012b4670fd9cd39e3f944ec670307659e7b40c8379ef36a258e4507d23d486","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-04-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-04/G1-04_現況圖_01.png","width":2712,"height":2181,"label":"G1-04 現況圖","scenario":"G1-04","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":47,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image37.png","sha256":"d543c1617fd9fc96d02358a7f1eee6e468abc5211ff2d684d1d061d4401cbf4d"},"results:g1-04-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-04/G1-04_現況照片_01.png","width":2477,"height":1393,"label":"G1-04 現況照片","scenario":"G1-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":48,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image38.png","sha256":"16d01eec630dd572f4312297966c259a1641d1dd39163d5f5b02c6b52a1b6644"},"results:g1-04-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-0